## Model card

- **Name:** Nemotron 3.5 Bolt E4B
- **Short description:** Compact 4GB edge-optimized open-weight small language model designed by NVIDIA for ultra-low latency on-device conversational agents, voice assistants, and game NPC dialogue.
- **Provider / access:** NVIDIA / Hugging Face (scheduled release October 23, 2026); local deployment on GeForce RTX, Jetson, and RTX/DGX Spark systems.
- **Release / knowledge:** 2026-10-23 (announced 2026-10-15); knowledge cutoff Q3 2026.
- **IDs:** `nvidia/nemotron-3.5-bolt-e4b`
- **Context window:** Scaled down context architecture optimized for low memory footprint (~4GB VRAM footprint) and fast TTFT / streaming.
- **Modalities:** Text in/out, structured tool-calling, conversational JSON schemas.
- **Pricing (as of 2026-10-17):** Open weights (free local execution / Apache-2.0 or NVIDIA Open Model License).
- **Architecture:** Compact edge SLM architecture optimized for ~4GB VRAM execution footprint; hybrid dense/recurrent or lightweight Transformer architecture.

